# Downloaded dataset cache.
#
# `drug200.csv` (8 KB) and the SCMS export (3.6 MB) are tracked, so the core of the
# project works straight from a clone. The Indian medicine master is 30 MB, which is
# a real cost on every clone for a file that is one command away, so it is fetched
# instead:
#
#     python scripts/fetch_data.py
#
# `--verify` on that script reports what is cached and checks row counts, so a
# truncated download fails loudly rather than putting wrong numbers on a page.
data/external/indian_medicine_data.csv
data/processed/
